[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/td72/vig/issues/178","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/td72/vig","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/td72/vig/issues/178/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/td72/vig/issues/178/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/td72/vig/issues/178/events","html_url":"https://github.com/td72/vig/issues/178","id":5396265962,"node_id":"I_kwDORNPWJs8AAAABQaR76g","number":178,"title":"Projects: auto-refresh the board on ProjectV2.updatedAt","user":{"login":"td72","id":12109493,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEyMTA5NDkz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/12109493?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/td72","html_url":"https://github.com/td72","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/td72/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/td72/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/td72/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/td72/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/td72/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/td72/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/td72/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/td72/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/td72/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":10179374926,"node_id":"LA_kwDORNPWJs8AAAACXrzvTg","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/td72/vig/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","color":"a2eeef","default":true,"description":"New feature or request"}],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":0,"created_at":"2026-09-09T07:13:44Z","updated_at":"2026-09-09T07:13:44Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"OWNER","active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"## Motivation\n\nThe board only refreshes on `r` or when the page is re-entered after five minutes. Agents move items across Status columns and edit fields while the page sits open, and those edits are invisible to the GitHub page's change check: measured on the demo project, editing item dates bumped every item's `updatedAt` and **`ProjectV2.updatedAt`** but left the issues' own `updatedAt` untouched.\n\n## Spec\n\n1. **Change detection (1 point)** — while the Projects page is shown, poll `projectV2 { updatedAt }` (measured cost: 1 point) every `projects-poll-interval` and refetch the board (~3 points over the GraphQL path) only when it moved. `Board` carries `updated_at`, read for free by the meta query (fields + views + count), so the first comparison needs no extra request.\n2. **Interval** — a new top-level `projects-poll-interval` (default `\"30s\"`, minimum `\"5s\"`; documented in the Config Reference and defaults dump), separate from the GitHub page's 5 s because each probe costs a point: 120 points/hour with the page open, 20 in idle mode.\n3. **Governed like every other poll** — the #168 refresh scale (idle ×6, under 20 % ×2, stopped under 5 % or with `github-auto-refresh \"off\"`) applies; a rate-limited probe engages the same backoff as the GitHub page.\n4. **Selection survives** — `set_board` already keeps the selected item by id and the shown view; lanes, columns, table sort and roadmap scroll are preserved across the swap.\n5. **Status bar** — the existing `board Ns ago` plus a brief `↻ updated` when a refresh was triggered.\n6. **Fixtures / tests** — the probe joins `vig fixtures record`; unit tests cover unchanged / changed `updatedAt`; the fixture integration test checks that an unchanged probe does not refetch.\n\nCompanion of the GitHub lists issue: that page's REST ETag check is free but blind to project field edits, hence the separate mechanism here.","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/td72/vig/issues/178/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/td72/vig/issues/178/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null}]
